{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-prosperous city was destroyed overnight by an invasion by a demon army. The survivors fled to the &quot;Silver Lake Village&quot; and desperately built walls to hold out, but the demons' onslaught continues. It's only a matter of time before the village falls. Their only hope lies with you, the legendary hero who can reclaim the devastated land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a &quot;growth&quot;-focused RPG, where players constantly strive to become stronger. The core gameplay flow is as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle (Monster Slaying): Explore dangerous dungeons and fields, slaying countless monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth (Level Up): Defeat monsters to gain experience and level up. Distribute stats and acquire new skills to develop your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming &amp; Crafting: Obtain materials or blueprints from monsters. Use these to craft powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancement: Enhance crafted or acquired items to become even more powerful and prepare for the next dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These four processes are organically linked to provide the fun of 'killing stronger monsters -&gt; obtaining/crafting better rewards -&gt; strengthening stronger items -&gt; achieving higher levels'.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2478750?t=1766396933","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2478750?t=1766396933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478750/3fc65669129d613f6e358619c56453e0b6a7cceb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766396933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478750/3fc65669129d613f6e358619c56453e0b6a7cceb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766396933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-prosperous city was destroyed overnight by an invasion by a demon army. The survivors fled to the &quot;Silver Lake Village&quot; and desperately built walls to hold out, but the demons' onslaught continues. It's only a matter of time before the village falls. Their only hope lies with you, the legendary hero who can reclaim the devastated land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a &quot;growth&quot;-focused RPG, where players constantly strive to become stronger. The core gameplay flow is as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle (Monster Slaying): Explore dangerous dungeons and fields, slaying countless monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth (Level Up): Defeat monsters to gain experience and level up. Distribute stats and acquire new skills to develop your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming &amp; Crafting: Obtain materials or blueprints from monsters. Use these to craft powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancement: Enhance crafted or acquired items to become even more powerful and prepare for the next dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These four processes are organically linked to provide the fun of 'killing stronger monsters -&gt; obtaining/crafting better rewards -&gt; strengthening stronger items -&gt; achieving higher levels'.</p>","developers":["MoonlightGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2478750/5c8a1615f2050150a47267d34c9d40ef2dc65693/header.jpg?t=1766396933","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2019 Moonlight Games private enterprise","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2478750/1622144210/3d3f361e0944e2142e8b1323d3ffdda6381b3c29/1765912888/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766396843","dash_h264"